{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上９時開始投票。截至早上10時，投票率44.74%，2554名選民投票，而合資格投票人數為5709人。<br/>\n<br/>\n其中商界（第三）投票率最高，有98.23%，111人已投票，界別選民人數有113人，其次是漁農界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是商界（第二），有16.16%，16人已投票，界別選民人數有99人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:01:57.380732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T02:27:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:37:46.544143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T02:55:30.668638+00:00","content_hash":"743b1305cacad25d28457a3cec44720a05fc466084a052cee70770affdb57817","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}